{"task_id": "HumanEval/63", "solution": "_fibfib_memo = {\n    0: 0,\n    1: 0,\n    2: 1\n}\ndef fibfib(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"The FibFib number sequence is a sequence similar to the Fibbonacci sequnece that's defined as follows:\n    fibfib(0) == 0\n    fibfib(1) == 0\n    fibfib(2) == 1\n    fibfib(n) == fibfib(n-1) + fibfib(n-2) + fibfib(n-3).\n    Please write a function to efficiently compute the n-th element of the fibfib number sequence.\n    >>> fibfib(1)\n    0\n    >>> fibfib(5)\n    4\n    >>> fibfib(8)\n    24\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a non-negative integer.\")\n\n    if n in _fibfib_memo:\n        return _fibfib_memo[n]\n\n    # Recursive calculation for n > 2\n    result = fibfib(n - 1) + fibfib(n - 2) + fibfib(n - 3)\n    _fibfib_memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/64", "solution": "class VowelCounter:\n    STANDARD_VOWELS = {'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u'}\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def vowels_count(word: str) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Counts vowels in a word, including 'y' if it is the last character.\n        Standard vowels ('a','e','i','o','u') are counted case-insensitively.\n        \"\"\"\n        if not isinstance(word, str):\n            raise TypeError(\"Input must be a string.\")\n\n        count = 0\n        lower_word = word.lower()\n\n        for char in lower_word:\n            if char in VowelCounter.STANDARD_VOWELS:\n                count += 1\n\n        if len(lower_word) > 0 and lower_word[-1] == 'y':\n            count += 1\n\n        return count"}
